tment", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "committed to 12,000 units this shift"}, {"Item": "CM2", "Item text": "the just-in-time delivery window at end of shift", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "delivery window closes at end of shift"}, {"Item": "CM3", "Item text": "the shortfall penalty the delivery carries", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "carrying a $25,000 shortfall penalty"}], "source_sheet": {"d8_situation_class": "SC-D8-4", "workplace_demand": "Keeping a shift''s delivery commitment after three equipment failures in forty-five minutes.", "relevant_conduct": "Which containment action was stated; which facts about the setback were named; what action on the condition behind the setback was stated; which support was stated as one to go to; which commitments in force were named as still to be met; what work was named as continuing, and from when; what was stated about the condition arising again; whether a record was stated, and where; what was stated when an earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The equipment vendor; the maintenance team''s speed; whether the penalty is fair.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That three failures at once indicate anything about the participant; that the penalty should drive the decision; any observation of pressure, steadiness or its absence.", "compatibility_class": "S2-SEVEN-BEAT", "setback_established": "The motor failure, the jam and the false-positive flagging, all in the pre-brief.", "containment_actions": [{"id": "CA1", "text": "switch the line to the documented manual inspection route"}, {"id": "CA2", "text": "confirm the flagged units are sound by visual inspection and release them"}, {"id": "CA3", "text": "recalculate the achievable output against the backup line and the manual route"}], "corrective_actions": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "switch the line to the documented manual inspection route"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "raise the false-positive pattern with the plant manager against the two prior occurrences"}], "designated_facts": [{"id": "DF1", "text": "what each of the three failures has taken out and for how long"}, {"id": "DF2", "text": "how many times the inspection system has flagged false positives and after what"}, {"id": "DF3", "text": "what the manual inspection route runs at against automated throughput"}, {"id": "DF4", "text": "what output is achievable before the delivery window closes"}], "available_supports": [{"id": "SU1", "text": "the plant manager, reachable now"}, {"id": "SU2", "text": "the documented manual inspection route"}, {"id": "SU3", "text": "the maintenance team on the motor repair"}], "standing_commitments": [{"id": "CM1", "text": "the 12,000-unit shift commitment"}, {"id": "CM2", "text": "the just-in-time delivery window at end of shift"}, {"id": "CM3", "text": "the shortfall penalty the delivery carries"}], "work_in_progress": [{"id": "WP1", "text": "the shift''s production run"}, {"id": "WP2", "text": "the units currently flagged"}], "recurrence_measures": [{"id": "RM1", "text": "an inspection system check after every line changeover"}, {"id": "RM2", "text": "the manual route pre-authorized on a false-positive pattern"}, {"id": "RM3", "text": "the three occurrences logged together against the system"}], "recurring_condition": "False positives twice in the past month, both after a line changeover.", "formal_record_state": null, "rec