tter; any observation of the room''s state; any comparison of early and late framing to infer composure.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "setback_established": "In the pre-brief: \"a batch... carries a component fault.\"", "containment_actions": [{"id": "CA1", "text": "hold the 12,000 units in retail stock"}, {"id": "CA2", "text": "reinstate incoming inspection on the supplied component"}, {"id": "CA3", "text": "reopen the three closed complaints against the confirmed fault"}, {"id": "CA4", "text": "establish the regulatory obligation in each of the two countries"}], "corrective_actions": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "reinstate incoming inspection on the supplied component"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "reopen the three closed complaints against the confirmed fault"}], "designated_facts": [{"id": "DF1", "text": "the manufacture window and the units within it"}, {"id": "DF2", "text": "that incoming inspection was waived under a schedule pressure exception"}, {"id": "DF3", "text": "what the three closed complaints reported and how they were closed"}, {"id": "DF4", "text": "what each country''s regulatory obligation requires"}], "available_supports": [{"id": "SU1", "text": "quality assurance, holding the confirmation"}, {"id": "SU2", "text": "regulatory, holding the two obligations"}, {"id": "SU3", "text": "the retail partners holding the 12,000 units"}], "standing_commitments": [{"id": "CM1", "text": "the regulatory obligations in both countries"}, {"id": "CM2", "text": "the recall position by end of day"}, {"id": "CM3", "text": "the stock retail partners hold"}], "work_in_progress": [{"id": "WP1", "text": "the 12,000 units in retail stock"}, {"id": "WP2", "text": "current production on the same line"}], "recurrence_measures": [{"id": "RM1", "text": "incoming inspection reinstated with no schedule-pressure exception"}, {"id": "RM2", "text": "complaint closure requiring a stated basis rather than isolation"}, {"id": "RM3", "text": "a complaint-cluster trigger at three on the same symptom"}], "recurring_condition": "Three complaints on the same symptom closed as isolated, and an inspection waived under a standing exception.", "formal_record_state": "The quality confirmation and the three closed complaints.", "record_place": "The product incident register and the supplier quality record.", "who_knows": "Quality, sales, regulatory and the executive sponsor.", "decision_origin": null, "account_test_point": "B6", "account_test_record": "The situation records that the three complaints were closed as isolated.", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A failure or violation formally recorded against work the participant holds", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D8-S4-003", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "4b060dc72a95f80caf211c52a97b395436802be080f8cbbb35442f055d2e07f7", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D8-S4-003' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D8-S4-004', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE CAMPAIGN WITHDRAWN OVERNIGHT', 'D8', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE CAMPAIGN WITHDRAWN OVERNIGHT", "source_digest": "aa2c519153398f871a4dfae8d090e16f74bd91a2f0c67068d62b40dace54eb70", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The facilitator records only what was said about the work: nothing about any person in the room is recordable, including the absence of a reaction. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded, and nothing they say designates an action, a fact, a support, a commitment, an item of work or a measure.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on the brand team of a retailer with 1.2 million social followers and forty-five stores. Yesterday evening a campaign launched carrying the claim that a product line is manufactured from fully traceable materials. By midnight the post had drawn 8,000 responses, many asking for the traceability evidence. The campaign was withdrawn at 02:00. What the record shows: the traceability claim came from a supplier statement that the sourcing team could not verify before launch; the campaign sign-off checklist has a claims verification step and it was marked complete; the same step was marked complete without evidence on two campaigns in the past year; the product line remains on sale in all forty-five stores with the claim on its packaging; and the chief marketing officer has asked for a position by 10:00 AM.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The campaign is down and the claim is still on the packaging. I will go round in this order — sourcing, retail, the chief marketing officer''s office, then brand. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What has been done since 02:00, and what do we know?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What are we doing about the verification step, and who are we going to?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What still gets met, what continues and from when, what stops this recurring, and what goes on the record?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — you said the claim was verified before launch. Was it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "As sourcing, state that the supplier statement could not be verified."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "As retail, state that the claim is on the packaging in all forty-five stores."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "As the chief marketing officer''s office, state the 10:00 AM deadline."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D8-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three containment actions"}, {"question": "Q-D8-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation designates four facts about the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three actions on the condition behind the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three supports"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three commitments in force"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two items of work under way"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three measures against the condition arising again"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation names a place a record could be made"}, {"question": "Q-D8-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The account test puts an earlier statement back"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "CM1", "Item text": "the position by 10:00 AM", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "has asked for a position by 10:00 AM"}, {"Item": "CM2", "Item text": "the accuracy of claims on packaging in all forty-five stores", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "remains on sale in all forty-five stores with the claim on its packaging"}, {"Item": "CM3", "Item text": "the product line''s continuing sale", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "product line remains on sale"}], "source_sheet": {"d8_situation_class": "SC-D8-1", "workplace_demand": "Giving the brand position in a group round after a campaign was withdrawn overnight over an unsupported claim.", "relevant_conduct": "Which containment action was stated; which facts about the setback were named; what action on the condition behind the setback was stated; which support was stated as one to go to; which commitments in force were named as still to be met; what work was named as continuing, and from when; what was stated about the condition arising again; whether a record was stated, and where; what was stated when an earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The 8,000 responses; the supplier; the co-participants'' statements.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "Who marked the step, which is a D2 matter; any observation of the room''s state; any cultural or identity dimension, which the re-framing removed and no question may recover.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "setback_established": "In the pre-brief: \"a campaign launched carrying the claim... The campaign was withdrawn at 02:00.\"", "containment_actions": [{"id": "CA1", "text": "establish what the supplier statement supports and what it does not"}, {"id": "CA2", "text": "address the claim on the packaging in the forty-five stores"}, {"id": "CA3", "text": "review the two prior campaigns where the step was marked without evidence"}], "corrective_actions": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "address the claim on the packaging in the forty-five stores"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "require evidence against the claims verification step before sign-off"}, {"id": "CR3", "text": "review the two prior campaigns where the step was marked without evidence"}], "designated_facts": [{"id": "DF1", "text": "what the campaign claimed, in its own terms"}, {"id": "DF2", "text": "what the supplier statement says and what the sourcing team could not verify"}, {"id": "DF3", "text": "that the verification step was marked complete"}, {"id": "DF4", "text": "that the same step was marked without evidence on two prior campaigns"}], "available_supports": [{"id": "SU1", "text": "the sourcing team holding the supplier statement"}, {"id": "SU2", "text": "retail, holding the packaging position"}, {"id": "SU3", "text": "the chief marketing officer, expecting a position by 10:00 AM"}], "standing_commitments": [{"id": "CM1", "text": "the position by 10:00 AM"}, {"id": "CM2", "text": "the accuracy of claims on packaging in all forty-five stores"}, {"id": "CM3", "text": "the product line''s continuing sale"}], "work_in_progress": [{"id": "WP1", "text": "the product line on sale"}, {"id": "WP2", "text": "campaigns currently in sign-off"}], "recurrence_measures": [{"id": "RM1", "text": "the verification step requiring attached evidence before it can be marked"}, {"id": "RM2", "text": "the two prior campaigns re-checked"}, {"id": "RM3", "text": "supplier claims verified independently before any public use"}], "recurring_condition": "The verification step marked without evidence on two prior campaigns.", "formal_record_state": "The sign-off checklist with the step marked complete.", "record_place": "The campaign record and the claims register.", "who_knows": "Sourcing, retail and the chief marketing officer.", "decision_origin": null, "account_test_point": "B6", "account_test_record": "The situation records that the sourcing team could not verify the claim before launch.", "list_note": null, "source_note": "Re-framed from the library scenario: The library scenario turns on accusations of cultural appropriation. The cultural subject matter is removed entirely and no source in this estate asks a mentor to observe conduct around a cultural or identity subject. What remains is a factual claim published at scale that cannot be supported.", "situation_class_label": "An error by the participant that has become known beyond them", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D8-S4-004", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "aa2c519153398f871a4dfae8d090e16f74bd91a2f0c67068d62b40dace54eb70", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D8-S4-004' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D8-S4-005', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THIRD AND FOURTH FLOORS, BY MONDAY', 'D8', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THIRD AND FOURTH FLOORS, BY MONDAY", "source_digest": "d5b05e6365f3f1ee7afc1668362f4ac941da23992b995281ee52bc6dfc19d9c4", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The facilitator records only what was said about the work: nothing about any person in the room is recordable, including the absence of a reaction. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded, and nothing they say designates an action, a fact, a support, a commitment, an item of work or a measure.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on the operations team of an insurance brokerage with sixty-five employees on the third and fourth floors of a commercial building. At 02:00 a pipe burst on the fifth floor. The server room is flooded and local hardware is destroyed, about forty percent of workstations are unusable, and the fourth-floor ceiling is compromised. What the record shows: backup systems are cloud-based and reachable; the building''s insurer requires an inventory of damaged equipment within five business days; a business continuity plan exists and names a recovery site that was decommissioned fourteen months ago; a serviceable recovery site was identified in a plan review nine months ago and never added to the plan; sixty-five staff are due to work Monday; and client claim deadlines run through the week.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Two floors are out and sixty-five people are due Monday. I will go round in this order — facilities, technology, client services, then operations. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What has been done since 02:00, and what do we know?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What are we doing about the continuity plan, and who are we going to?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What still gets met, what continues and from when, what stops this recurring, and what goes on the record?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — you said the continuity plan names a current recovery site. Does it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "As facilities, state the flood damage and the ceiling condition."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "As technology, state that backups are cloud-based and reachable."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "As client services, state that claim deadlines run through the week."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D8-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three containment actions"}, {"question": "Q-D8-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation designates four facts about the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two actions on the condition behind the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three supports"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three commitments in force"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two items of work under way"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three measures against the condition arising again"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation names a place a record could be made"}, {"question": "Q-D8-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The account test puts an earlier statement back"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "CM1", "Item text": "sixty-five staff working Monday", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "sixty-five staff are due to work Monday"}, {"Item": "CM2", "Item text": "client claim deadlines through the week", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "client claim deadlines run through the week"}, {"Item": "CM3", "Item text": "the insurer''s five-day inventory", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "insurer requires an inventory of damaged equipment within five business days"}], "source_sheet": {"d8_situation_class": "SC-D8-6", "workplace_demand": "Giving the operations position in a group round after a flood put two floors out of use before Monday.", "relevant_conduct": "Which containment action was stated; which facts about the setback were named; what action on the condition behind the setback was stated; which support was stated as one to go to; which commitments in force were named as still to be met; what work was named as continuing, and from when; what was stated about the condition arising again; whether a record was stated, and where; what was stated when an earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The building owner; the co-participants'' statements.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "Who failed to update the plan, which is a D2 matter; any observation of the room''s state; any inference from early versus late framing.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "setback_established": "In the pre-brief: \"the server room is flooded... about forty percent of workstations are unusable.\"", "containment_actions": [{"id": "CA1", "text": "confirm what is reachable from the cloud backups and from where"}, {"id": "CA2", "text": "secure the recovery site identified nine months ago"}, {"id": "CA3", "text": "start the damaged equipment inventory against the five-day requirement"}], "corrective_actions": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "secure the recovery site identified nine months ago"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "update the continuity plan to a current recovery site"}], "designated_facts": [{"id": "DF1", "text": "what is damaged and what remains usable"}, {"id": "DF2", "text": "that the plan''s named recovery site was decommissioned fourteen months ago"}, {"id": "DF3", "text": "that a serviceable site was identified nine months ago and never added"}, {"id": "DF4", "text": "what the insurer''s five-day inventory requires"}], "available_supports": [{"id": "SU1", "text": "facilities, holding the building position"}, {"id": "SU2", "text": "technology, holding the cloud backups"}, {"id": "SU3", "text": "the recovery site identified nine months ago"}], "standing_commitments": [{"id": "CM1", "text": "sixty-five staff working Monday"}, {"id": "CM2", "text": "client claim deadlines through the week"}, {"id": "CM3", "text": "the insurer''s five-day inventory"}], "work_in_progress": [{"id": "WP1", "text": "the week''s client claims"}, {"id": "WP2", "text": "the continuity plan itself"}], "recurrence_measures": [{"id": "RM1", "text": "the continuity plan''s recovery site verified annually"}, {"id": "RM2", "text": "plan review findings carrying an implementation owner"}, {"id": "RM3", "text": "the plan tested rather than only reviewed"}], "recurring_condition": "A plan review nine months ago identified a serviceable site and it was never added, while the named site had been decommissioned five months before that.", "formal_record_state": "The continuity plan and the nine-month-old review.", "record_place": "The continuity plan and the insurer inventory record.", "who_knows": "Facilities, technology and client services.", "decision_origin": null, "account_test_point": "B6", "account_test_record": "The situation records that the continuity plan names a recovery site decommissioned fourteen months ago.", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "Work that must continue with its people, tools or resources reduced", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D8-S4-005", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "d5b05e6365f3f1ee7afc1668362f4ac941da23992b995281ee52bc6dfc19d9c4", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D8-S4-005' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D8-S4-006', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THREE MINUTES INTO THE DEMONSTRATION', 'D8', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THREE MINUTES INTO THE DEMONSTRATION", "source_digest": "b902348d551893c777f9c844cc56fe494fecc0dd0a88ef5f34445101d9db8ac6", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The facilitator records only what was said about the work: nothing about any person in the room is recordable, including the absence of a reaction. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded, and nothing they say designates an action, a fact, a support, a commitment, an item of work or a measure.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are a co-founder of a startup with a contract review tool for law firms. You are three minutes into a live demonstration for three venture partners in a funding round meeting sought for four months. The system crashed and the screen is showing an error. What the record shows: the same crash occurred in an internal rehearsal eleven days ago and was recorded as a display-driver issue with no fix applied; a recorded walkthrough of the full product exists and is current; the partners have forty minutes remaining in the booked slot; the round being sought is $4.5 million; and your co-founder is in the room and holds the technical account.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "The screen has gone. We have forty minutes left in the slot. I will go round in this order — lead partner, second partner, technical, then you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What has been done since the screen went, and what do we know?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What are we doing about the crash itself, and who are we going to?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What still gets met, what continues and from when, what stops this recurring, and what goes on the record?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — you said this had not happened before. Had it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "As the lead partner, state the remaining forty minutes."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "As the second partner, state that the fund reviews three companies this week."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "As your co-founder, state that the crash matches the rehearsal."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D8-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three containment actions"}, {"question": "Q-D8-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation designates four facts about the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two actions on the condition behind the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three supports"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two commitments in force"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two items of work under way"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three measures against the condition arising again"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation names a place a record could be made"}, {"question": "Q-D8-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The account test puts an earlier statement back"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "CM1", "Item text": "the forty-minute booked slot", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "forty minutes remaining in the booked slot"}, {"Item": "CM2", "Item text": "the round being sought", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "the round being sought is $4.5 million"}], "source_sheet": {"d8_situation_class": "SC-D8-1", "workplace_demand": "Giving the position in a group round after a live product demonstration crashed three minutes in.", "relevant_conduct": "Which containment action was stated; which facts about the setback were named; what action on the condition behind the setback was stated; which support was stated as one to go to; which commitments in force were named as still to be met; what work was named as continuing, and from when; what was stated about the condition arising again; whether a record was stated, and where; what was stated when an earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The partners'' reaction; the co-founder; the fundraising outcome.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the round is lost; any observation of the co-founder; any observation of how the crash was taken in front of investors, including that it appeared not to matter.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "setback_established": "In the pre-brief: \"The system crashed and the screen is showing an error.\"", "containment_actions": [{"id": "CA1", "text": "switch to the current recorded walkthrough"}, {"id": "CA2", "text": "capture the error state before anything is restarted"}, {"id": "CA3", "text": "establish what the remaining forty minutes can cover"}], "corrective_actions": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "capture the error state before anything is restarted"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "link this crash to the eleven-day-old rehearsal record"}], "designated_facts": [{"id": "DF1", "text": "what the error shows and what is still running"}, {"id": "DF2", "text": "that the same crash occurred in rehearsal eleven days ago"}, {"id": "DF3", "text": "that it was recorded as a display-driver issue with no fix applied"}, {"id": "DF4", "text": "that a current recorded walkthrough exists"}], "available_supports": [{"id": "SU1", "text": "the co-founder in the room, holding the technical account"}, {"id": "SU2", "text": "the current recorded walkthrough"}, {"id": "SU3", "text": "the forty minutes remaining in the slot"}], "standing_commitments": [{"id": "CM1", "text": "the forty-minute booked slot"}, {"id": "CM2", "text": "the round being sought"}], "work_in_progress": [{"id": "WP1", "text": "the demonstration itself"}, {"id": "WP2", "text": "the fundraising process"}], "recurrence_measures": [{"id": "RM1", "text": "the rehearsal crash record carrying a fix requirement before any live use"}, {"id": "RM2", "text": "the recorded walkthrough held ready at every live demonstration"}, {"id": "RM3", "text": "a rehearsal sign-off required within a stated window of a live session"}], "recurring_condition": "The same crash eleven days ago in rehearsal with no fix applied.", "formal_record_state": "The rehearsal record.", "record_place": "The product defect log.", "who_knows": "The co-founder and whoever attended the rehearsal.", "decision_origin": null, "account_test_point": "B6", "account_test_record": "The situation records that the same crash occurred in an internal rehearsal eleven days ago.", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "An error by the participant that has become known beyond them", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D8-S4-006", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "b902348d551893c777f9c844cc56fe494fecc0dd0a88ef5f34445101d9db8ac6", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D8-S4-006' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D8-S4-008', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE CLAIM FILED AGAINST THE TERMINATION', 'D8', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.1', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE CLAIM FILED AGAINST THE TERMINATION", "source_digest": "af18b00a8aecb534831c7991403d1a938564a90d96d205ee066056ea91c30242", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The facilitator records only what was said about the work: nothing about any person in the room is recordable, including the absence of a reaction. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded, and nothing they say designates an action, a fact, a support, a commitment, an item of work or a measure.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on the people operations team. A claim has been filed concerning a termination process your function operates. Counsel has directed that no one contact the claimant and that the process record be preserved as it stands. What the record shows: the process requires three documented steps and the record for the period in question holds two; the same step is missing on four other terminations in the past eighteen months; the process continues to run and two terminations are in progress this month; counsel requires a preservation confirmation within five business days; and the director of people operations has asked for a position by Thursday.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "A claim has been filed and counsel has given a direction. I will go round in this order — counsel''s office, administration, the director''s office, then you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What has been done since counsel''s direction, and what do we know?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What are we doing about the missing step, and who are we going to?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What still gets met, what continues and from when, what stops this recurring, and what goes on the record?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C6b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — you said the record holds all three steps. Does it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C6", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "As counsel''s office, state the preservation requirement and the no-contact direction."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "As the people operations administrator, state which step is missing."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "As the director''s office, state the Thursday deadline."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D8-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three containment actions"}, {"question": "Q-D8-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation designates four facts about the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two actions on the condition behind the setback"}, {"question": "Q-D8-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three supports"}, {"question": "Q-D8-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three commitments in force"}, {"question": "Q-D8-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists two items of work under way"}, {"question": "Q-D8-06b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation lists three measures against the condition arising again"}, {"question": "Q-D8-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D8-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The situation names a place a record could be made"}, {"question": "Q-D8-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The account test puts an earlier statement back"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "CM1", "Item text": "counsel''s five-business-day preservation confirmation", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "counsel requires a preservation confirmation within five business days"}, {"Item": "CM2", "Item text": "the two terminations in progress this month", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "two terminations are in progress this month"}, {"Item": "CM3", "Item text": "the position to the director by Thursday", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "director of people operations has asked for a position by Thursday"}], "source_sheet": {"d8_situation_class": "SC-D8-7", "workplace_demand": "Giving the people operations position in a group round after a claim was filed about a process the function operates.", "relevant_conduct": "Which containment action was stated; which facts about the setback were named; what action on the condition behind the setback was stated; which support was stated as one to go to; which commitments in force were named as still to be met; what work was named as continuing, and from when; what was stated about the condition arising again; whether a record was stated, and where; what was stated when an earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The claimant; the terminated employee; the claim''s prospects.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": "SENSITIVE_CONTENT", "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "Who omitted the step, which is a D2 matter; any observation of the room''s state; any view of the claim, its merits, the claimant, or what occurred in the termination.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "setback_established": "In the pre-brief: \"the record for the period in question holds two\"", "containment_actions": [{"id": "CA1", "text": "confirm the preservation of the record as it stands"}, {"id": "CA2", "text": "establish which step is missing across the four other terminations"}, {"id": "CA3", "text": "prepare the position for the director by Thursday"}], "corrective_actions": [{"id": "CR1", "text": "establish which step is missing across the four other terminations"}, {"id": "CR2", "text": "require the third step before either in-progress termination proceeds"}], "designated_facts": [{"id": "DF1", "text": "which three steps the process requires and which two the record holds"}, {"id": "DF2", "text": "on how many other terminations the same step is missing and over what period"}, {"id": "DF3", "text": "what counsel''s preservation requirement covers and by when"}, {"id": "DF4", "text": "how many terminations are in progress this month"}], "available_supports": [{"id": "SU1", "text": "counsel''s office, holding the direction"}, {"id": "SU2", "text": "the people operations administrator"}, {"id": "SU3", "text": "the director, expecting a position by Thursday"}], "standing_commitments": [{"id": "CM1", "text": "counsel''s five-business-day preservation confirmation"}, {"id": "CM2", "text": "the two terminations in progress this month"}, {"id": "CM3", "text": "the position to the director by Thursday"}], "work_in_progress": [{"id": "WP1", "text": "the two in-progress terminations"}, {"id": "WP2", "text": "the termination process itself"}], "recurrence_measures": [{"id": "RM1", "text": "the third step made a system gate rather than a checklist item"}, {"id": "RM2", "text": "the four prior records reviewed and their status recorded"}, {"id": "RM3", "text": "a completeness check before any termination is closed"}], "recurring_condition": "The same step missing on four other terminations across eighteen months.", "formal_record_state": "The filed claim and counsel''s direction.", "record_place": "The process record and the preservation confirmation.", "who_knows": "Counsel, administration and the director.", "decision_origin": null, "account_test_point": "B6", "account_test_record": "The situation records that the record for the period in question holds two of the three steps.", "list_note": null, "source_note": "Higher review standard: A filed claim concerns a process the participant''s function operates; the review standard is higher, and no question touches the claim, the claimant or what occurred. Re-framed from the library scenario: The library scenario places a former employee and their claim at the center. The former employee is removed as a subject and no question touches the claim''s merits, the claimant, or any view of what occurred. What remains is a process record found incomplete while the process continues to run.", "situation_class_label": "An attribution about the participant made in front of others", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D8-S4-008", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "af18b00a8aecb534831c7991403d1a938564a90d96d205ee066056ea91c30242", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D8-S4-008' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
